+  /// Called only *once* for the lifetime of the op, so any one-time allocations
+  /// should be made here (unless they depend on tensor sizes).
+  ///
+  /// * If a built-in op:
+  ///       * `buffer` is the op's params data (TfLiteLSTMParams*).
+  ///       * `length` is zero.
+  /// * If custom op:
